		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"PBS Wiki / LLM / Zine 現有系統圖 / Current System Map\n只描繪目前已存在、正在被使用或已在 vault/code 中有明確位置的系統。\nOnly systems that currently exist in the vault or codebase are shown.\n閱讀方向 / Reading direction: 玩家入口 Player entry -> Prompt/LLM -> Vault/Source/Schema -> Output/Review.","x":-1700,"y":-1050,"width":920,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"layer-title","type":"text","text":"PBS LLM Wiki: Three Layers / 三層分法\nSources stay raw. Wiki compiles reusable knowledge. Schema + Agents keep behavior repeatable.\n原始材料保持原貌；Wiki 將知識整理成可讀可查的 reusable notes；Schema + Agents 讓維護與輸出行為一致。","x":-1700,"y":-1530,"width":760,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"layer-raw","type":"text","text":"1. Raw / 原始材料\nCaptured source material, preserved as source.\n\nPBS 對應 / In PBS:\n• Sources indexes\n• Hackteria / SGMK / related source families\n• sourceCards / excerpts / source links\n\nPrinciple: preserve the source.\n原則：保留來源，不把來源本身改寫成答案。","x":-850,"y":-1530,"width":500,"height":270,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"layer-wiki","type":"text","text":"2. Wiki / 整理後知識\nCompiled knowledge for humans and agents.\n\nPBS 對應 / In PBS:\n• Wiki pages\n• Concepts / Materials / Methods / NPCs / Pets / Zines\n• Semantic layers\n• Entity layers\n• Question runtime contract\n\nPrinciple: make small reusable notes.\n原則：拆成可重用的小知識單元。","x":-200,"y":-1530,"width":520,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"layer-runtime","type":"text","text":"Runtime surfaces / 實際輸出表面\n\nPBS Computer, NPC, Pet, and Zine are not a fourth knowledge layer.\nThey are interfaces that read from Wiki/Raw and obey Schema/Agents.\n\nPBS Computer、NPC、Pet、Zine 不是第四層知識；它們是讀取 Raw/Wiki 並受 Schema 約束的使用者介面。","x":1810,"y":-1530,"width":520,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"wiki-npcs","type":"file","file":"Wiki/NPCs/README.md","x":620,"y":740,"width":240,"height":110,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"wiki-pets","type":"file","file":"Wiki/Pets/README.md","x":900,"y":740,"width":240,"height":110,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"wiki-zines","type":"file","file":"Wiki/Zines/README.md","x":1180,"y":740,"width":240,"height":110,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"public-role","type":"text","text":"Public wiki pages / 公開 Wiki 頁面用途\n\nLayer / 層級: 2. Wiki, not Raw\n\n• 使用者可讀的入口頁 / reader-facing entry pages\n• PBS Computer search corpus\n• zine/public artifact 語意背景 / semantic background\n• NPC / pet / zine docs 公開索引 / public indexes","x":1460,"y":590,"width":260,"height":270,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"wiki-concepts","type":"file","file":"Wiki/Concepts/README.md","x":620,"y":590,"width":240,"height":110,"color":"2"},
