		{"id":"visual-guard","type":"text","text":"Visual layout guard\n../webview-ui/scripts/check-visual-layout-guards.mjs\n\n目前存在 / Current:\n• emoji control 尺寸檢查 / emoji control size checks\n• zine/PBS Computer UI source guard\n• build 前可執行 / can run before build:\nnpm run check:visual-layout","x":2250,"y":250,"width":320,"height":190,"color":"5"},
