		{"id":"layer-schema-agents","type":"text","text":"3. Schema + Agents / 規則與代理\nThe operating system for the vault.\n\nPBS 對應 / In PBS:\n• Schema docs\n• lint checklist\n• source manifest\n• llm wiki maintainer\n• agentic firewall\n• review folders\n• visual guards\n\nPrinciple: make behavior repeatable.\n原則：讓 AI/人類維護行為可重複。","x":490,"y":-1530,"width":520,"height":320,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"layer-agent-loop","type":"text","text":"Agent Loop / 代理循環\n\nSchema instructs agents.\nAgents maintain Wiki.\nWiki cites Raw.\nOutputs feed Review.\n\n規則指示代理；代理維護 Wiki；Wiki 回連 Raw；輸出回到 Review。","x":1175,"y":-1510,"width":430,"height":230,"color":"1"}
